   "date": "2013-05-16",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "Moved to suspend standing orders so that 14 bills related to DisabilityCare Australia (the National Disability Insurance Scheme) could be considered during the current sitting period; the motion was agreed to."
  },
  {
   "slug": "speech-823467",
   "speaker": "Jacinta Collins",
   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2013-05-16",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The government argued for increasing the Medicare levy from 1.5% to 2% from July 2014 to fund DisabilityCare Australia, and announced the establishment of the DisabilityCare Australia Fund and technical amendments to the NDIS Act. The scheme will roll out from July 2013 in launch sites"
  }
